        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>申報 - THE SHENG PAO - MARCH 20th 1939</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #e8e2d3;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    color: #2a241c;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 1050px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #eee8da;\n    border: 3px solid #2a241c;\n    padding: 15px 25px 25px 25px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #2a241c;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .topbar .date-en {\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .topbar .masthead-en {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .topbar .pub-daily {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n    border-bottom: 3px double #2a241c;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .vertical-text {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    height: 470px;\n  }\n  .vertical-text.small {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .vertical-text.bold-title {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #d9d3c2;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .photo1 {\n    width: 355px;\n    height: 400px;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .photo2 {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 420px;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .masthead-cn {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 88px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: 10px;\n    height: 460px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    border-left: 2px solid #2a241c;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n    margin-left: 5px;\n  }\n  .date-column-group {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 460px;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    gap: 22px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    padding-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .date-column-group .row {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .headline-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .headline-group .vertical-text {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    height: 470px;\n  }\n  .nanjing-block {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 6px;\n    height: 470px;\n  }\n  .nanjing-title {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    height: 130px;\n  }\n  .bank-list {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    height: 320px;\n  }\n  .tonggao {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    height: 100px;\n    align-self: flex-end;\n  }\n  .col-group {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"date-en\">MARCH&nbsp;&nbsp;20<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;1939</div>\n    <div class=\"masthead-en\">THE&nbsp;&nbsp;SHENG&nbsp;&nbsp;PAO</div>\n    <div class=\"pub-daily\">PUBLISHED DAILY</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- TOP SECTION -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo1\">[Photo: two men walking under an archway, top-left]</div>\n      <div class=\"vertical-text small\" style=\"height:60px; margin-top:5px;\">開展工作正式近期將要員會方後，已拜抵滬。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\">\n      秘書處長，協助其兄處理日常公務。明氏兄弟抵滬後，明誠則出任經濟司\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\">\n      特務委員會副主任。明誠則出任經濟司明氏將主持華東物資統制事宜，並兼任\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\">\n      氏昨日抵滬，隨行者有其弟明誠。據悉，\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\">\n      【本報上海訊】新政府經濟司要員明樓\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text\">\n      攜弟明誠履新 主持物資統制事宜\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text\">\n      新政府經濟司要員明樓抵滬\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"masthead-cn\">申報</div>\n\n    <div class=\"date-column-group\">\n      <div class=\"row\">中華民國三十八年</div>\n      <div class=\"row\">西曆一千九百三十九年</div>\n      <div class=\"row\">三月二十號　星期一</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- BOTTOM SECTION -->\n  <div class=\"section\" style=\"border-bottom:none;\">\n\n    <div class=\"nanjing-block\">\n      <div class=\"nanjing-title\">南京</div>\n      <div class=\"bank-list\">\n        上海銀行<br>興民銀行<br>四行儲蓄會\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bank-list\" style=\"height:120px;\">\n        照常營业<br>五月二十五日<br>休业五日\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-group\">\n      <div class=\"bank-list\">交通銀行<br>中央銀行<br>中國銀行<br>江蘇銀行</div>\n      <div class=\"bank-list\">國華銀行<br>大陸銀行<br>中國銀行<br>金城銀行</div>\n      <div class=\"bank-list\">中國寶業銀行<br>中國農工銀行<br>浙江興業銀行</div>\n      <div class=\"tonggao\">通告</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder photo2\">[Photo: street scene with shop signs and pedestrians, center]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\" style=\"height:460px;\">\n      閩門石路漸複元氣，菜館茶館反較戰前興隆。鄉民紛紛返城，然物價日昂，升門小民謀一飽亦難，光景終非昔比。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\" style=\"height:460px;\">\n      浦僑胞再接再厲，共盡救國責任。國抗戰正值艱難，海外支援不可稍懈，望利物動員僑胞繼續捐款捐物、抵制日貨。函稱，祖\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vertical-text small\" style=\"height:460px;\">\n      【本報巴黎訊】全歐華僑抗日救國會昨致函利物浦中國國民抗日救國會，通報國內戰局，\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"headline-group\">\n      <div class=\"vertical-text\">呼籲加緊輸財救國</div>\n      <div class=\"vertical-text\">全歐抗聯會致函利物浦僑胞</div>\n      <div class=\"vertical-text\" style=\"font-size:32px;\">商有利銀公司今日開幕</div>\n      <div class=\"vertical-text\" style=\"font-size:32px;\">比</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
